{"id":2680,"date":"2025-11-10T18:28:52","date_gmt":"2025-11-10T18:28:52","guid":{"rendered":"..\/..\/..\/..\/index.html"},"modified":"2025-12-01T21:37:00","modified_gmt":"2025-12-01T21:37:00","slug":"biologia-2025","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"..\/..\/..\/..\/biologia-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Campo: Biolog\u00eda"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"2680\" class=\"elementor elementor-2680\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52b7061f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"52b7061f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5aa2e4b7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5aa2e4b7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a0285c0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1a0285c0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"..\/..\/..\/..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/alexalvarado-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1202\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"..\/..\/..\/..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/alexalvarado-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/alexalvarado-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/alexalvarado-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/alexalvarado-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/alexalvarado.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-417b43bf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"417b43bf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6de9acf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6de9acf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"> Wilber Alexander Alvarado<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6016272 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6016272\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Bioinform\u00e1tica en Acci\u00f3n: Epidemiolog\u00eda Gen\u00f3mica de Enfermedades Infecciosas\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b362fe5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b362fe5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Descripci\u00f3n del taller:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> La epidemiolog\u00eda gen\u00f3mica, que combina la gen\u00f3mica de pat\u00f3genos con estudios epidemiol\u00f3gicos, est\u00e1 cambiando las pr\u00e1cticas de salud p\u00fablica y control de infecciones gracias a la adopci\u00f3n de tecnolog\u00edas de secuenciaci\u00f3n de alto rendimiento en la vigilancia de enfermedades. El curso ofrece una introducci\u00f3n al an\u00e1lisis de epidemiolog\u00eda gen\u00f3mica con tutoriales pr\u00e1cticos haciendo uso de herramientas bioinform\u00e1ticas. Estos tutoriales proporcionar\u00e1n datos y casos de ejemplo e instrucciones detalladas para instalar herramientas bioinform\u00e1ticas o acceder a aplicaciones web p\u00fablicas y utilizarlas para el an\u00e1lisis. Los participantes ganar\u00e1n experiencia aplicando t\u00e9cnicas de epidemiolog\u00eda gen\u00f3mica a casos reales, prepar\u00e1ndolos para utilizar estas herramientas en su propia investigaci\u00f3n o en salud p\u00fablica.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a584e6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9a584e6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e7f73a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8e7f73a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bea40d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7bea40d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"..\/..\/..\/..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/New-Project-27-1024x1024.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1442\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"..\/..\/..\/..\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/New-Project-27-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/New-Project-27-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/New-Project-27-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/New-Project-27-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/New-Project-27.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10894fc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"10894fc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab7135b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ab7135b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Alexandra Martinez Lopez<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75e13f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"75e13f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Procesamiento de Im\u00e1genes Biol\u00f3gicas para la Investigaci\u00f3n Biom\u00e9dica<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a88288e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a88288e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Descripci\u00f3n del taller:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> En este taller utilizaremos un software de procesamiento de im\u00e1genes para aprender sobre el an\u00e1lisis de im\u00e1genes de inmunotinci\u00f3n, una t\u00e9cnica muy utilizada en la investigaci\u00f3n biom\u00e9dica y neurocient\u00edfica. Este m\u00e9todo utiliza tejidos humanos o de ratones para investigar cambios biol\u00f3gicos en tejidos enfermos frente a tejidos sanos. Revisaremos la teor\u00eda sobre la fijaci\u00f3n de tejidos, la inmunohistoqu\u00edmica y la microscop\u00eda. Por \u00faltimo, tendr\u00e1n la oportunidad de analizar las im\u00e1genes ustedes mismos. A trav\u00e9s del an\u00e1lisis de im\u00e1genes podremos cuantificar las c\u00e9lulas o prote\u00ednas de inter\u00e9s en un tejido y utilizar esta informaci\u00f3n para hacer observaciones informadas sobre los cambios biol\u00f3gicos en el tejido enfermo.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Wilber Alexander Alvarado Bioinform\u00e1tica en Acci\u00f3n: Epidemiolog\u00eda Gen\u00f3mica de Enfermedades Infecciosas Descripci\u00f3n del taller: La epidemiolog\u00eda gen\u00f3mica, que combina la gen\u00f3mica de pat\u00f3genos con estudios epidemiol\u00f3gicos, est\u00e1 cambiando las pr\u00e1cticas de salud p\u00fablica y control de infecciones gracias a la adopci\u00f3n de tecnolog\u00edas de secuenciaci\u00f3n de alto rendimiento en la vigilancia de enfermedades. El curso [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2680","page","type-page","status-publish"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2680","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"."}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2680"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2680\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2880,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2680\/revisions\/2880"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2680"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}